{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 What if the next time you woke up you had no memories,\u00a0 were holding a gun and hunted by deranged people?\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>\u00a0 </i></strong><i>Find out what you're made of in this <strong>unique blend of RNG and skill-based progression</strong><span class=\"bb_strike\"> </span></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/extras/milogif_bb1.gif?t=1742761735\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive</strong> as long as you can and <strong>save the rats</strong> that are tormented by Milo and his followers. Leverage the corpses to empower you and survive longer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/extras/milogif_bb2.gif?t=1742761735\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with others in the Global Leaderboards in the <strong><i>&quot;Basketball&quot;</i></strong> mini-game flaunt your skill</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pop the corpses</strong> and use slain cultists against their sadistic leader, Milo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drink</strong> from the Cream Machine to upgrade your character </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/extras/COLLECT_GIF_NEW.gif?t=1742761735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/extras/PLAY_GIF_REDUX.gif?t=1742761735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/extras/DRINKUPGRADE_GIF.gif?t=1742761735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2022Four unique guns (M1 Garand, Thompson, Walther PPK, and Trenchgun) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022Blood, gore/dismemberment, custom procedural animation, and enemy AI was designed from the ground-up to make every play session feel unique and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2691620?t=1742761735","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742761735","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742761735","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742761735","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Milo contains graphic violence and gore. You use various weapons to attack and there are rats that eat corpses."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 What if the next time you woke up you had no memories,\u00a0 were holding a gun and hunted by deranged people?\u00a0</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>\u00a0 </i></strong><i>Find out what you're made of in this <strong>unique blend of RNG and skill-based progression</strong><span class=\"bb_strike\"> </span></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/extras/milogif_bb1.gif?t=1742761735\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive</strong> as long as you can and <strong>save the rats</strong> that are tormented by Milo and his followers. Leverage the corpses to empower you and survive longer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/extras/milogif_bb2.gif?t=1742761735\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with others in the Global Leaderboards in the <strong><i>&quot;Basketball&quot;</i></strong> mini-game flaunt your skill</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pop the corpses</strong> and use slain cultists against their sadistic leader, Milo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drink</strong> from the Cream Machine to upgrade your character </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/extras/COLLECT_GIF_NEW.gif?t=1742761735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/extras/PLAY_GIF_REDUX.gif?t=1742761735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691620/extras/DRINKUPGRADE_GIF.gif?t=1742761735\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2022Four unique guns (M1 Garand, Thompson, Walther PPK, and Trenchgun) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022Blood, gore/dismemberment, custom procedural animation, and enemy AI was designed from the ground-up to make every play session feel unique and satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Spencer Sharp","rat cream games LLC"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2665020","name":"Milo"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"